{"availability":"available","full":"arkade-os/compiler","name":"compiler","description":"EXPERIMENTAL A high-level language that compiles to Arkade Script for building Bitcoin-native smart contracts on Arkade OS","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":17,"forks":5,"created":"2025-02-25T00:26:33Z","updated":"2026-10-08T12:13:33Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://arkade-os.github.io/compiler","topics":[],"demo":"https://arkade-os.github.io/compiler","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:21.435Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:21.435Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:03:21.435Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:58.621Z","stars":17,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:24.386Z","stars":17,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:21.435Z","stars":17,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Arkade Language is a contract language for Bitcoin. You write a contract as a set of spend functions over constructor state. The compiler, arkadec, turns it into a JSON artifact with two kinds of script: Arkade covenants, which the Arkade VM executes offchain, and L1 tapscript leaves, which give every party a unilateral exit on Bitcoin. Arkade libraries consume the artifact directly, and arkade-bindgen turns it into typed TypeScript or Go stubs.","The language covers signature and multisig checks, absolute and relative timelocks, transaction introspection, Arkade Assets and asset groups, byte-string parsing, fixed-size arrays, structs, and recursive contract instantiation with new."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arkade-os/compiler/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"88ba79fda25c2d6597744c1287e4862c0081aa21271901af312f2bdd2c7c79ac","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:56:53.679Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:56:53.679Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Arkade Language is a contract language for Bitcoin. You write a contract as a set of spend functions over constr